<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτῑμώρ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unavenged,</i> i.e.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>unpunished,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γίγνεσθαι</span> to <i>escape
				punishment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.100
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.6
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἁμαρτημάτων</span>
			<i>unpunished for</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				959c
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτῑμώρ-τως</span></b> 
			<i>with impunity,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				762d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>for whom no revenge has been taken,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				3.3.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτιμώρητον ἐᾶν θάνατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.145
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>undefended, unprotected,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.57
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
